      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Ganglia may be found near any joint. The hip joint is one location where these lesions have been reported. In most instances the ganglia found around the hip are small, deep-seated, and not palpable. Palpable ganglia are commonly larger and present as a groin mass. We report a ganglion cyst that was not palpable due to its intrapelvic location."},
